name=ArtisanROM 990 Instagram Soft Reboot Fix
version=v2.2
versionCode=8
author=WhiteAssassins
description=Exynos 990: disables the broken afterimage-compensation screen capture (config_AFC_type 5->0) and, only while Instagram (apps.txt) is open, turns off blur and window transition animations and switches notification pop-ups to Detailed (no edge lighting blur), preventing SurfaceFlinger soft reboots. Everything is restored when you leave the app.
